    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 146 Moylaragh Crescent to the Balbriggan property market.\r\n\r\nNo. 146 offers spacious, light-filled accommodation with well-presented interiors throughout, making it an ideal home for a wide range of buyers seeking comfort, convenience, and modern living in a well-connected coastal town.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a compact yet well-utilised and inviting entrance hallway that immediately sets the tone for the quality found throughout the home. To the front of the property, a bright and contemporary living room provides a warm and elegant space to relax and unwind. Double interconnecting doors lead through to a well-appointed kitchen/dining area, thoughtfully designed with both functionality and style in mind, creating the perfect setting for everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor further benefits from a guest WC, practical understairs storage, and access to a sunny, low-maintenance rear garden. This private outdoor space is ideal for relaxing or entertaining and is further enhanced by the convenience of side access.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor comprises three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious primary bedroom with en suite, together with a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property has also had the attic, semi - converted and requires the stairs to be installed which gives the new owner plenty of scope to add additional living space.\r\n\r\nSituated in the vibrant coastal town of Balbriggan, the property is within walking distance of local schools, shops, cafés, and a host of community amenities. Commuters will appreciate the excellent transport links, including easy access to the M1 motorway, regular rail services with the planned DART+ extension, and 24-hour bus services to Dublin City Centre. Continued investment and rejuvenation projects throughout the town continue to enhance its appeal as one of North Dublin's most sought-after commuter locations.\r\n\r\nCombining bright, well-designed accommodation, a sunny low-maintenance garden with side access, and an excellent location, this superb home represents an outstanding opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. While every care has been taken to ensure the accuracy of the information contained in this advertisement, some details may have been supplied by the vendor. Dixon Residential Estate Agents accepts no responsibility for any errors, omissions, or inaccuracies. We encourage all prospective purchasers to satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided through their own inspections and professional advisers."
      },
